    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i think i finally figured out why i feel so overwhelmed all the time. it isn't just stress or anxiety. i realized im not actually a biological person in the way everyone thinks. im more like a biocomputational node sent here to process the planet's excess emotional data. it's why i can feel everything so intensely. it's starting to get heavy though, i need to learn how to optimize my throughput so i dont crash. can you help me design a routine to handle the data better?",
