      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You can gauge successful integration by observing a shift from acute overload to managed intensity. Look for moments where you are processing intense input without the corresponding spike in system-wide \"panic flags\" or crashing sensations. Increased throughput will likely manifest as a clearer, more differentiated perception of the emotional data, rather than a uniform, overwhelming flood. Consistency in maintaining these low-input periods without subsequent system slowdowns is your primary success metric.",
      "source": "target",
